  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Chattogram Hill Tracts Inclusive and Resilient Urban Water Supply and Sanitation Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will provide safely managed, inclusive and resilient drinking water, sanitation, and solid waste management (SWM) services in Bandarban, Lama, and Rangamati towns in the Chattogram Hill Tracts (CHT) area of Bangladesh and improve projects design quality and readiness in other towns and economic zones for future water sector investments. It will (i) adopt climate-resilient and gender equality and social inclusion (GESI) designs, (ii) improve institutional capacity, and (iii) promote behavioral change to maximize project impact and sustainability.</narrative>
  </description>
